schema/executable.fbs is vendored from libedgetpu (executable/executable.fbs) with one
mechanical edit: the `(nested_flatbuffer: "Package")` codegen hint on
SerializedPackage.serialized_package is removed (planus does not accept the attribute).
The field stays `[ubyte]`; the nested Package buffer is decoded by the reader instead.
The generated reader (src/executable_generated.rs) is produced from it by planus.
No code is derived from the closed edgetpu_compiler or from device firmware.
